<title>INDIA: India's Vijaya Bank 96/97 net at 189.6 mln rupees.</title>
<headline>India's Vijaya Bank 96/97 net at 189.6 mln rupees.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's Vijaya Bank posted a net profit of 189.6 million rupees ($ 5.30 million) in the 1996/97 year ended in March, the Press Trust of India (PTI) said.</p>
<p>It did not give any comparative figure.</p>
<p>The news agency said Vijaya Bank's total deposits increased to 68.27 billion rupees in 1996/97 from 59.89 billion rupees in the previous year.</p>
<p>The bank's operating profit in 1996/97 rose to 347.7 million rupees from 49.1 million rupees in the previous year, the PTI said.</p>
<p>($1 = 35.8 rupees)</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
